arent, without a body. If, after this, it be fed wisely with the Arcanum of human blood, and be nourished for up to forty weeks, and be kept in the even heat of the horse\u2019s womb, a living human child grows therefrom, with all its members like another child, which is born of a woman, but much smaller.<span style=\"font-size:11px\"><u>&quot;</u></span></i><br /> <br /> Oh in 1175 10 homonculi with the ability to see the future were supposed to be created, so that's another thing to add, I wonder if that was the inspiration for the virtually omniscient Ronnie from Baccano!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 06-08-2014, 02:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}